## 💼 Resume & ATS-Optimized Project Descriptions

### 1️⃣ One-Line Quick Summary (For Profile Headlines)
> Developed an interactive Power BI dashboard that unifies supply chain logistics data to optimize inventory turnover ratios and reduce costly stockout incidents.

### 2️⃣ Short Summary (For Experience Sections)
> Engineered a comprehensive Power BI dashboard analyzing warehouse inventory metrics and vendor delivery performance. Built dynamic DAX measures to calculate inventory turnover and forecast accuracy, providing operational managers with data-driven insights that cut carrying costs and prevent stockouts.

### 3️⃣ Detailed ATS-Friendly Professional Breakdown (For Resumes)
**Supply Chain BI Developer & Inventory Analyst Portfolio Project**
* Designed and implemented an end-to-end Power BI analytics engine that tracks core logistics operational data across multiple warehousing networks and global supply regions.
* Modeled data with a clean star-schema design pattern. Cleaned and prepared data using advanced Power Query transformations, ensuring reliable data formatting across all fields.
* Formulated custom DAX measures to compute inventory turnover ratios, forecast accuracy, average supplier lead times, and on-time delivery percentages (%OTD).
* Created an executive-ready dashboard with intuitive navigation controls, clear KPI cards, and smart conditional alerts. The final solution gives logistics teams actionable, data-driven visibility that helps lower holding costs and optimize safety stock levels.
